1
00:00:00,450 --> 00:00:02,472
Have you ever caught your cat

2
00:00:02,472 --> 00:00:04,704
staring at an empty corner?

3
00:00:05,354 --> 00:00:07,616
For thousands of years, people have

4
00:00:07,616 --> 00:00:10,163
linked cats with the spirit world.

5
00:00:10,813 --> 00:00:13,616
In ancient Egypt, cats were living images

6
00:00:13,616 --> 00:00:16,837
of Bastet, a goddess who guarded the home.

7
00:00:17,487 --> 00:00:19,075
Millions of cats were

8
00:00:19,075 --> 00:00:21,165
mummified as offerings.

9
00:00:21,815 --> 00:00:23,745
And Herodotus wrote that when

10
00:00:23,745 --> 00:00:25,675
the family cat died, everyone

11
00:00:25,675 --> 00:00:27,755
shaved off their eyebrows.

12
00:00:28,405 --> 00:00:32,019
In medieval Europe, the mood turned dark.

13
00:00:32,219 --> 00:00:34,660
A papal letter of 1233 described

14
00:00:34,660 --> 00:00:37,406
a black cat at a devil-worship rite,

15
00:00:37,406 --> 00:00:40,654
and black cats became tied to witches.

16
00:00:41,304 --> 00:00:43,665
Yet in Britain and Japan, a black

17
00:00:43,665 --> 00:00:46,305
cat crossing your path is lucky.

18
00:00:46,955 --> 00:00:49,261
And Japanese folklore says a very

19
00:00:49,261 --> 00:00:51,358
old cat can become a bakeneko,

20
00:00:51,358 --> 00:00:53,385
a shape-shifting spirit.

21
00:00:55,435 --> 00:00:58,558
So what is your cat really seeing?

22
00:00:59,208 --> 00:01:02,080
Cats hear up to 64,000 hertz.

23
00:01:02,080 --> 00:01:04,806
We stop at about 20,000.

24
00:01:05,456 --> 00:01:07,592
Mice squeak in ultrasound,

25
00:01:07,592 --> 00:01:10,243
far too high for us to hear.

26
00:01:10,893 --> 00:01:12,955
And cats see with about a

27
00:01:12,955 --> 00:01:15,531
sixth of the light we need.

28
00:01:16,181 --> 00:01:18,143
The ghost in the corner is

29
00:01:18,143 --> 00:01:20,255
usually a sound or a flicker

30
00:01:20,255 --> 00:01:22,718
that only the cat can catch.

31
00:01:23,368 --> 00:01:25,441
Not spirits. Just senses

32
00:01:25,441 --> 00:01:27,345
sharper than ours.

